    {
      "source": "DeFiHackLabs",
      "text": "Flashloans & Price Manipulation. Lost: 36,044 USDT"
    },
    {
      "source": "DeFiHackLabs explorer",
      "text": "Incorrect price calculation by balanceOf Vulnerable code snippet: https://bscscan.com/address/0x93c175439726797dcee24d08e4ac9164e88e7aee#code#F1#L254"
    },
    {
      "source": "SlowMist",
      "text": "According to SlowMist, the EGD Finance project on BSC was attacked by hackers, resulting in the unexpected withdrawal of funds from its pool. The SlowMist security team analyzed this and said that this incident was because the price-feeding mechanism for calculating rewards when EGD Finance's contracts obtained rewards was too simple, resulting in the token price being manipulated by flash loans for profit."
    },
    {
      "source": "RevertIQ",
      "text": "EGD Finance was exploited via spot price manipulation on BNB Chain on August 7, 2022. The attacker used flash loans to artificially depress the EGD/USDT price, increasing their reward calculation and extracting approximately $36,000 worth of EGD tokens. The contract used an unprotected spot price from the EGD/USDT PancakeSwap pair in its reward calculation. The attacker used flash loans to drain USDT from the pair, reducing the denominator in the reward formula and dramatically increasing their claimable EGD reward."
    }
  ],
